DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260917
DTSTAMP:20260821T112242Z
UID:ce1407d47566a62624d998d3c3e1@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The legendary tale of Swan Lake takes flight in a breathtaking
  production from World Ballet Company\, as fate and magic entwine in a tim
 eless battle between good and evil. Featuring a cast of 50 international d
 ancers\, over 150 radiant hand-sewn costumes\, and stunning hand-crafted s
 ets\, this spellbinding performance captures every heart-pounding moment -
  from the Dance of the Little Swans to the Black Swan’s iconic 32 fouett
 és\, and every pirouette in between.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/event
 s/world-ballet-company-swan-lake
LOCATION:The Klein\, 910 Fairfield Avenue\, Bridgeport CT\, 06605
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/world-ballet-company-swan-lake
END:VEVENT
